{"s":"BRKSN.IS","upd":"2026-11-07T07:07:02Z","profile":{"longName":"Berkosan Yalitim Ve Tecrit Maddeleri Üretim Ve Ticaret A.S.","shortName":"BERKOSAN YALITIM","sector":"Industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","industry":"Conglomerates","industryDisp":"Conglomerates","country":"Turkey","city":"Istanbul","website":"https://www.berkosan.com","fullTimeEmployees":196,"longBusinessSummary":"Berkosan Yalitim Ve Tecrit Maddeleri Üretim Ve Ticaret A.S. engages in the manufacture, import, and export of insulation and insulation materials in Turkey and internationally. The company offers flat-bonded polyethylene, polypropylene and cross-linked polyethylene foam for sectors, such as construction, automotive, packaging, fitting, shoes and bags, and lifestyle. It also provides a range of services, such as interstory screed application to wall and roof insulation; soundproofing and thermal insulation in parquet to refrigerate cooler vehicle insulation; air conditioning inside and outside tools to sound and vibration isolation; heat and noise prevention in mechanical installations; and sound and vibration absorbing band. In addition, the company offers heat and sound insulation; solar energy system isolation; split air-conditioning system isolation; heating system isolation; material for sports, sea, and entertainment products; and wastewater system isolation. It provides its products under the Foamex, Airpack, Polyberk, Proberk, Airfoam, and Reflekt X brand names. The company was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Istanbul, Turkey.","quoteType":"EQUITY","exchange":"IST","fullExchangeName":"Istanbul","currency":"TRY","financialCurrency":"TRY","firstTradeDateMilliseconds":1303367400000},"stats":{"marketCap":495144000,"enterpriseValue":374873312,"trailingPE":58.777775,"priceToBook":0.5386965,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.64113724,"enterpriseToRevenue":0.485,"enterpriseToEbitda":2.853,"profitMargins":0.01601,"grossMargins":0.38454,"operatingMargins":0.13833,"ebitdaMargin